    "Two count/timing runs and one trace run; no statistical significance test.",
    "performance.now is quantized; zero timer samples do not mean no work.",
    "Wrappers, MutationObserver, signatures and tracing perturb timings/memory. Diagnostic elapsed/heap are not normal latency/leak evidence.",
